title: Marked for Death
subtitle: Nationalist killers plan a murder.
new-page: true
tags: event
priority: -1
view-if: {!
if (typeof RG === 'undefined') { return false; }
if (!RG.lw && this.game.scenes.lw_lib) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.lw_lib.onArrival); }
return !!(RG.lw && RG.lw.ready('c_assassin'));
!}
on-arrival: {!
if (!RG.lw) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.lw_lib.onArrival); }
var c = RG.lw.fire('c_assassin');
RG.lw.setC('cm', c);
Q.lw_name = Q.time <= 54 ? 'the Organisation Consul' : 'a nationalist murder squad';
Q.lw_dead = 0;
!}

= Marked for Death

A young sailor who drinks in the wrong bars has come to the party office white in the face. He heard men of [+ lw_name +] talk about **[+ lw_cm_name +]**: the address, the times of the trams, the café where [+ lw_cm_name +] reads the papers on Thursdays. They have a car and two pistols. [? if time >= 32 : They mentioned Erzberger, and laughed. ?]

- @guard: Give [+ lw_cm_name +] a bodyguard from the red guard.
- @police: Report the plot to the police.
- @public: Print the plot, with the names we know.

@guard
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. Almost certainly safe.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no funds.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
Q.red_guards_loyalty += 4;
if (Math.random() < 0.04) { Q.lw_dead = 1; }
!}

Four men from the red guard move into the flat next door.

- @after: Continue...

@police
subtitle: The Republic may protect its citizens. The killers of Eisner were treated gently.
on-arrival: {!
if (Math.random() < 0.25) { Q.lw_dead = 1; }
Q.stability += 1;
!}

A detective inspector takes down the sailor's statement and posts a constable at the corner for a week.

- @after: Continue...

@public
subtitle: The killers lose the surprise, though perhaps not the will.
on-arrival: {!
Q.worker_support += 2;
if (Math.random() < 0.12) { Q.lw_dead = 1; }
!}

Die Rote Fahne prints everything we know under the headline "Murder planned", with the number of the car.

- @after: Continue...

@after
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lw_dead == 1) {
    RG.kill(Q.lw_cm, {news: Q.lw_cm_name + ' shot dead by nationalist assassins', priority: 3});
    RG.ledger(Q.lw_cm_name + ' was murdered by ' + Q.lw_name + '.', 'lw_murder_' + Q.lw_cm);
    Q.militancy += 6;
    Q.worker_support += 4;
    Q.unity += 4;
} else {
    RG.news('Plot to murder ' + Q.lw_cm_name + ' foiled', 2);
}
!}

[? if lw_dead = 1 : It happens anyway, on a Thursday, outside the café. Two shots from a passing car. [+ lw_cm_name +] dies on the pavement before the ambulance comes. The murderers are never found. ?][? if lw_dead = 0 : The Thursday comes and goes. The car is seen once more, outside the wrong café, and then not again. ?]
